{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日になりましたが、プリンシパル4日目終了しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きてくださった皆さんありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと体も心も慣れてきまして、自分のやる役についてなど、考えながらやれるかなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、二回回しの\n一回目は沢村小坊主\n二回目は女中5でしたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、沢村を完璧にしたい願望が芽生えてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女中さん意外と難しい‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女中らしくってなんだろう？と日々考え中！\nあぁ、難しい！\nぎゃーすぎゃーす！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/07/9943918/0000.gif","alt":""},{"t